<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were steady.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to largely Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 69.00-70.00, load and part load uniformly Choice 1250-1375 lbs 70.50-71.00. Select 63.00-68.50.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to Choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 69.00-70.00. Select 60.00-67.50.</p>
</text>
